# Day 5 — Data Visualization & Exploratory Data Analysis

## Overview
This project focuses on understanding and visualizing data before applying machine learning models.
EDA was performed using Python visualization libraries.

## Dataset
- Titanic dataset (seaborn)

## Tools & Libraries
- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn

## Key Visualizations
- Histograms for age and fare distributions
- Countplots for gender, class, and survival
- Correlation heatmap for feature relationships

## Insights
- Passenger class has a strong influence on survival
- Higher fares are associated with higher survival probability
- Females had higher survival rates than males
- Deck column has significant missing values

## Outcome
This project demonstrates the importance of EDA in understanding data patterns, relationships,
and preparing data for machine learning models.
